## The model

Inkling-2-Mini is a model of Thinking Machines Lab (Apache-2.0, https://huggingface.co/thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini). The pack served by this recipe,
`vcruz305/Inkling-2-Mini-SAGE-REXL3-4.23bpw`, is vcruz305's. SAGE is our own mixed-precision quantization method for EXL3. The method is not published.
No model weights are in this repository.

## References read for the model's semantics (no source copied; the oracle re-expresses them)

- Hugging Face `transformers`, `src/transformers/models/inkling2_loop/` (Apache-2.0), at the commits pinned in `oracle/README.md`.
- vLLM, `vllm/models/inkling2/` (PR #67325; Apache-2.0), at the commits pinned in `oracle/README.md`.

`oracle/inkling2_ref.py`, `oracle/dspark_ref.py` and the transcriptions under `oracle/tests/` are our own Python code written from those references; they cite the
file and lines they follow. Apache-2.0 allows this; the attribution is the citation.

