## The engine

The engine this recipe builds is REXL3 (AGPL-3.0-only): upstream https://github.com/REXL3/REXL3 at `02ef8cba920e1a86b911c6e20c248c43724ddd66` plus the series on
https://github.com/justincasey/REXL3 (branch `inkling2-mini`, see `README.md`). It is not part of this repository.

